# dist/ is committed on purpose: Hostinger installs with postinstall scripts
# disabled, which leaves esbuild's binary non-executable and makes `vite build`
# fail on the host. Shipping the built client means deploys only need
# `npm install` + start. Run `npm run build` before committing client changes.
